;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 10% 是加入购物车</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    http.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'http://api.example.com/cart'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        product_id: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">randomProductId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        quantity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 5% 是下单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    http.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'http://api.example.com/orders'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        cart_id: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">randomCartId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        payment_method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'credit_card'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  sleep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>注意事项</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>思考时间</strong>：真实用户在请求之间有停顿（阅读页面、填写表单），不模拟思考时间会过估并发</li>\n<li><strong>数据多样性</strong>：使用足够多的不同数据，避免测试被缓存命中率过高而美化</li>\n<li><strong>依赖隔离</strong>：第三方 API 应使用 Mock 或 Stub，避免外部依赖影响测试结果</li>\n<li><strong>预热</strong>：测试开始前给系统足够的预热时间（JIT 编译、缓存填充、连接池初始化）</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[生产流量分析] --&gt; B[识别关键场景]&#10;    B --&gt; C[确定流量比例]&#10;    C --&gt; D[准备测试数据]&#10;    D --&gt; E[编写测试脚本]&#10;    E --&gt; F[验证脚本正确性]&#10;    F --&gt; G[执行负载测试]&#10;    G --&gt; H[分析结果]&#10;    H --&gt; I{达标?}&#10;    I --&gt;|否| J[定位瓶颈]&#10;    J --&gt; K[优化]&#10;    K --&gt; G&#10;    I --&gt;|是| L[记录基线]\">graph LR\n    A[生产流量分析] --&gt; B[识别关键场景]\n    B --&gt; C[确定流量比例]\n    C --&gt; D[准备测试数据]\n    D --&gt; E[编写测试脚本]\n    E --&gt; F[验证脚本正确性]\n    F --&gt; G[执行负载测试]\n    G --&gt; H[分析结果]\n    H --&gt; I{达标?}\n    I --&gt;|否| J[定位瓶颈]\n    J --&gt; K[优化]\n    K --&gt; G\n    I --&gt;|是| L[记录基线]</pre><h2 id=\"结果分析与报告\">结果分析与报告</h2><p>负载测试的价值在于<strong>结果分析</strong>而非执行本身。关键指标需要从多个维度交叉分析。</p>\n<p><strong>延迟分析</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# k6 输出的关键指标&#10;# http_req_duration&#10;#   avg=45.2ms  min=2.1ms  med=32.1ms  max=2.1s  p(90)=85.3ms  p(95)=120.5ms  p(99)=450.2ms&#10;&#10;# 重点关注:&#10;# 1. P99 是否满足 SLO (例如 &lt; 500ms)&#10;# 2. P99/P50 比值 — 反映延迟分布的&quot;肥尾&quot;程度&#10;# 3. max 值是否异常 — 可能存在偶发的严重问题\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># k6 输出的关键指标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># http_req_duration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   avg=45.2ms  min=2.1ms  med=32.1ms  max=2.1s  p(90)=85.3ms  p(95)=120.5ms  p(99)=450.2ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 重点关注:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. P99 是否满足 SLO (例如 &#x3C; 500ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. P99/P50 比值 — 反映延迟分布的\"肥尾\"程度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. max 值是否异常 — 可能存在偶发的严重问题</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>吞吐量与延迟的关系曲线</strong>是最重要的分析图表。随着负载增加，观察延迟的变化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"QPS    P50(ms)  P99(ms)  错误率&#10;100    15       45       0%&#10;200    18       55       0%&#10;500    25       80       0%&#10;1000   35       150      0%     ← 线性增长阶段&#10;1500   55       350      0%     ← 拐点出现&#10;2000   120      800      0.5%   ← 开始降级&#10;2500   350      2100     5%     ← 严重过载&#10;3000   超时     超时     25%    ← 系统崩溃\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>QPS    P50(ms)  P99(ms)  错误率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>100    15       45       0%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>200    18       55       0%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>500    25       80       0%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1000   35       150      0%     ← 线性增长阶段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1500   55       350      0%     ← 拐点出现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2000   120      800      0.5%   ← 开始降级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2500   350      2100     5%     ← 严重过载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3000   超时     超时     25%    ← 系统崩溃</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>性能回归检测</strong>：将负载测试嵌入 CI/CD，每次发布前与基线对比：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub Actions 中运行 k6&#10;- name: Run load test&#10;  run: |&#10;    k6 run --out json=results.json load-test.js&#10;&#10;- name: Check thresholds&#10;  run: |&#10;    jq &#39;.metrics.http_req_duration.values[&quot;p(99)&quot;]&#39; results.json | \\&#10;    awk &#39;{if ($1 &gt; 500) {print &quot;P99 regression: &quot; $1 &quot;ms&quot;; exit 1}}&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Actions 中运行 k6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run load test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    k6 run --out json=results.json load-test.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Check thresholds</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    jq '.metrics.http_req_duration.values[\"p(99)\"]' results.json | \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    awk '{if ($1 > 500) {print \"P99 regression: \" $1 \"ms\"; exit 1}}'</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分析维度</th>\n<th>关注指标</th>\n<th>健康标准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>P50, P90, P99, max</td>\n<td>P99 &lt; SLO 目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>吞吐量</td>\n<td>实际 QPS vs 目标 QPS</td>\n<td>实际 ≥ 目标 × 1.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误率</td>\n<td>HTTP 5xx, 超时</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源利用率</td>\n<td>CPU, 内存, 连接数</td>\n<td>CPU &lt; 70%, 内存 &lt; 80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定性</td>\n<td>延迟方差, 吞吐量波动</td>\n<td>方差系数 &lt; 0.1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分布式负载生成\">分布式负载生成</h2><p>当单台测试机的资源不足以生成目标负载时，需要分布式负载生成。k6 Cloud、Locust 和 Gatling 都支持分布式执行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# Locust: 分布式负载测试&#10;# Master 节点&#10;# locust --master -f locustfile.py&#10;&#10;# Worker 节点（可以启动多个）&#10;# locust --worker --master-host=master_ip -f locustfile.py&#10;&#10;from locust import HttpUser, task, between&#10;&#10;class WebsiteUser(HttpUser):&#10;    wait_time = between(1, 5)&#10;&#10;    @task(6)&#10;    def browse(self):&#10;        self.client.get(&quot;/products&quot;)&#10;&#10;    @task(3)&#10;    def view_detail(self):&#10;        self.client.get(f&quot;/products/{self.random_id()}&quot;)&#10;&#10;    @task(1)&#10;    def purchase(self):&#10;        self.client.post(&quot;/orders&quot;, json={&quot;product_id&quot;: self.random_id()})&#10;&#10;    def random_id(self):&#10;        import random&#10;        return random.randint(1, 10000)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Locust: 分布式负载测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Master 节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># locust --master -f locustfile.py</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Worker 节点（可以启动多个）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># locust --worker --master-host=master_ip -f locustfile.py</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> locust </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HttpUser, task, between</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WebsiteUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HttpUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    wait_time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> between(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> browse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.client.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/products\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> view_detail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.client.get(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/products/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.random_id()</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> purchase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.client.post(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">json</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"product_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.random_id()})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> random_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> random</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> random.randint(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>分布式测试的注意事项：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>负载生成器本身不应成为瓶颈——监控测试机的 CPU 和网络</li>\n<li>确保所有 Worker 节点的时钟同步</li>\n<li>测试网络带宽应远大于目标系统的预期吞吐量</li>\n<li>从不同地理位置生成负载更贴近真实场景</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((负载测试))&#10;    测试类型&#10;      性能测试&#10;      压力测试&#10;      容量测试&#10;      浸泡测试&#10;    工具&#10;      k6&#10;      wrk&#10;      Locust&#10;      Gatling&#10;    场景设计&#10;      真实流量比例&#10;      思考时间&#10;      数据多样性&#10;      预热阶段&#10;    结果分析&#10;      延迟分布&#10;      吞吐量曲线&#10;      拐点识别&#10;      回归检测&#10;    持续集成&#10;      CI/CD 嵌入&#10;      基线对比&#10;      自动化门禁\">mindmap\n  root((负载测试))\n    测试类型\n      性能测试\n      压力测试\n      容量测试\n      浸泡测试\n    工具\n      k6\n      wrk\n      Locust\n      Gatling\n    场景设计\n      真实流量比例\n      思考时间\n      数据多样性\n      预热阶段\n    结果分析\n      延迟分布\n      吞吐量曲线\n      拐点识别\n      回归检测\n    持续集成\n      CI/CD 嵌入\n      基线对比\n      自动化门禁</pre><ul>\n<li>负载测试的目标是<strong>在生产问题发生之前发现它们</strong>，应该嵌入 CI/CD 而非仅在上线前执行</li>\n<li>测试场景必须<strong>模拟真实用户行为</strong>，包括流量比例、思考时间和数据多样性</li>\n<li><strong>吞吐量-延迟曲线</strong>是最重要的分析产出，拐点标识了系统的安全容量边界</li>\n<li><strong>P99/P50 比值</strong>反映了延迟分布的肥尾程度，比值越大说明长尾问题越严重</li>\n<li>性能回归检测通过与历史基线对比实现，在 CI 中设置自动化门禁防止性能退化</li>\n<li>负载测试的常见陷阱：忽略思考时间（过估并发）、缓存命中率偏高（过于乐观）、忽视预热阶段</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"负载测试","id":"负载测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"工具选型与脚本编写","id":"工具选型与脚本编写"},{"level":2,"text":"测试场景设计","id":"测试场景设计"},{"level":2,"text":"结果分析与报告","id":"结果分析与报告"},{"level":2,"text":"分布式负载生成","id":"分布式负载生成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可观测性与性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/system-tuning/observability-for-perf"},"next":null}